            <p>
              Kneading is a normal behavior that starts in kittenhood and often carries into adulthood. Cats
              may knead when they feel safe, cozy, or ready to settle in, and some also do it to mark an area
              with scent glands in their paws.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="example">
          <button class="faq-question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-4" id="question-4">
